          "xbrlb:labelRole": "Documentation",
          "rdf:value": {
            "@value": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. The exemption, and for the fundraising exemption the tier, the filing relates to. Form 1-CRYPTO Part I as proposed has no tier field, although the tier sets the offering limit and whether financial statements must be audited.",
