          "xbrlb:labelRole": "Documentation",
          "rdf:value": {
            "@value": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Signatures for the answer on offerings in the previous 12 months, given in the manner of Forms 10-K and 10-Q (the signature blocks of Forms 1-KC and 1-SC use the same words): an entity signs through a person duly authorized to sign on its behalf; a person signs on his or her own behalf; each signer's name and title are printed, and each capacity is shown. One value per capacity in which the person identified by the responsible signatory axis signs (1, 2, ...).",
