          "dct:title": "Regulation S-K, Item 304 (Changes in and disagreements with accountants on accounting and financial disclosure), 17 CFR 229.304",
          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "17 CFR 229.304(a)(1)(iv)",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"there were any disagreements with the former accountant on any matter of accounting principles or practices, financial statement disclosure, or auditing scope or procedure\"",
