          "dct:title": "Regulation S-K, Item 304 (Changes in and disagreements with accountants on accounting and financial disclosure), 17 CFR 229.304",
          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "17 CFR 229.304, Instruction 4",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"It is not necessary for there to have been an argument to have had a disagreement, merely a difference of opinion\"",
