          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "17 CFR 229.304, Instruction 5",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"an oral communication from the engagement partner or another person responsible for rendering the accounting firm's opinion (or their designee) will generally suffice\"",
