          "dct:title": "Regulation S-K, Item 304 (Changes in and disagreements with accountants on accounting and financial disclosure), 17 CFR 229.304",
          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "17 CFR 229.304(a)(1)(iv)(C)",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"state whether the registrant has authorized the former accountant to respond fully to the inquiries of the successor accountant concerning the subject matter of each of such disagreements and, if not, describe the nature of any limitation thereon and the reason therefore\"",
