          "dct:title": "Regulation S-K, Item 304 (Changes in and disagreements with accountants on accounting and financial disclosure), 17 CFR 229.304",
          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "17 CFR 229.304(a)(3)",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"The registrant shall file the former accountant's letter as an exhibit to the report on registration statement containing this disclosure\"",
