            "@type": "xsd:anyURI"
          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Affirmative statement that the enumerated list of affiliates engaged in blockchain network participation includes every affiliate so engaged, applying the control-based affiliate definition and not a narrower one chosen by the filer. This is the element that converts an omission from a silent arithmetic gap into an affirmative misstatement on the face of the filing.",
