            "@type": "xsd:anyURI"
          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Title of the officer attesting to the affiliate perimeter, as the issuer itself styles the position. Reported in addition to regca:AffiliatePerimeterAttestingOfficerRole, which normalises the officer into standard role categories; this element preserves the issuer's own title for the person.",
