            "@type": "xsd:anyURI"
          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Role category of the officer attesting to the affiliate perimeter. The residual member regca:FunctionalEquivalentExecutiveOfficerMember covers a signer who holds none of the listed titles but serves in the functional capacity of one; a signer who serves in no such capacity has no member to select.",
