            "@type": "xsd:anyURI"
          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. The proportion of a blockchain network's total active stake controlled, on that network, by the issuer together with every affiliate reported on that network. Stored as a fraction, so 0.34 is thirty-four per cent.",
