          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. For each non-affiliate third party that provides blockchain network participation services to or for the issuer: who it is, what it does, what it is paid, and any conflicts. Carried over from Section 8 of the BNP questionnaire (questions 137-148) without questions 142-145 on yield facilitation and reserve-to-yield relationships, which are specific to payment stablecoins. The items reported for a period are in a table of their own, \"Rule 103(b)(9) — third-party service provider arrangements for the period\".",
