            "@type": "xsd:anyURI"
          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Whether the issuer has given up or transferred the administrative rights and privileged roles it held in the smart contracts (for example, at a handover), and, for each right, its disposition and the on-chain proof. A right that ended, was destroyed or was transferred is shown with each transaction that carried it out; a right that is retained is listed without a transaction. Supports the certification in Item 2 of Form TR that all promised essential managerial efforts are completed or permanently ceased.",
          "mvf:hasSemanticReference": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/08/21/2026-17183/regulation-crypto-assets"
        },
