            "@type": "xsd:anyURI"
          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. The identifier (hash) of a transaction recorded on a blockchain network. Used in every table that cites an on-chain proof, so that every such proof in a filing can be found, and matched across filings, in the same way.",
