            "@type": "xsd:anyURI"
          },
          "cmns-dsg:hasDescription": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. The aggregate offering price (Rule 100) of a covered transaction that the issuer plans but has not made at the date of the disclosure. A row that states this value is a planned covered transaction; once the transaction is made, the consideration received is reported for it instead. The amount counted against the $5,000,000 limit of Rule 200(b)(4) is reported separately.",
