            "@value": "Number of units of covered investment contract offered, in the unit the issuer defines. Rule 101(e)(1) as proposed makes one unit of a covered investment contract one unit of the subject crypto asset; Auditchain Labs recommends that an issuer be permitted to define the unit as a functional unit - the subject crypto asset together with the software or other technical primitives the crypto asset invokes (for Pacioli.ai, a Pacioli Validating Node of 50,000 AUDT with its node software license) - with the Rule 101(e) measures reported alongside in the functional-unit elements. Where the unit is the crypto asset itself, the two agree.",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": [
            "regca-complete:reference/429",
            "regca-complete:reference/430",
            "regca-complete:reference/431"
          ],
          "mvf:hasMVFEntry": "regca-complete:mvf/entry/UnitsOfCoveredInvestmentContractsOffered"
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca:OfferingAbstract",
          "rdfs:label": {
            "@value": "Offering — Rule 103(b)(2) [abstract]",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": [
            "regca-complete:reference/427",
            "regca-complete:reference/428"
          ],
          "mvf:hasMVFEntry": "regca-complete:mvf/entry/OfferingAbstract"
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca:PurchasePricePerUnit",
          "rdfs:label": {
            "@value": "Purchase price per unit",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "skos:definition": {
            "@value": "Price per unit of the covered investment contract, in the unit the issuer defines (see UnitsOfCoveredInvestmentContractsOffered). Rule 101(e)(2) as proposed determines it by reference to the price per unit of the subject crypto asset; that measure is reported in EquivalentPurchasePricePerUnitOfSubjectCryptoAsset. If a price range is given, report the midpoint.",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": [
            "regca-complete:reference/432",
            "regca-complete:reference/433",
            "regca-complete:reference/434"
          ],
          "mvf:hasMVFEntry": "regca-complete:mvf/entry/PurchasePricePerUnit"
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca:PurchasePricePerUnitDeterminationMethod",
          "rdfs:label": {
            "@value": "How the purchase price per unit will be determined",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": "regca-complete:reference/435",
          "mvf:hasMVFEntry": "regca-complete:mvf/entry/PurchasePricePerUnitDeterminationMethod"
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca:OfferingPeriodDescription",
          "rdfs:label": {
            "@value": "Duration of the offering period",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": "regca-complete:reference/438",
          "mvf:hasMVFEntry": "regca-complete:mvf/entry/OfferingPeriodDescription"
        },
