            "@value": "Information eliminating confusion about the issuer's name",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "skos:definition": {
            "@value": "Required on the offering circular cover when the issuer's name is the same as, or confusingly similar to, that of a well-known company, or suggests a line of business it is not engaged in.",
