          },
          "skos:definition": {
            "@value": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule.",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": [
            "regca-complete:reference/2272",
            "regca-complete:reference/2273",
            "regca-complete:reference/2274",
            "regca-complete:reference/2275"
          ],
          "mvf:hasMVFEntry": "regca-complete:mvf/entry/PledgedOrEncumberedAssetsDescriptionExplanatory"
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca:IssuerBlockchainNetworkParticipationAbstract",
          "rdfs:label": {
            "@value": "Issuer blockchain network participation [abstract]",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "skos:definition": {
            "@value": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Blockchain Network Participation (BNP) disclosure: for each network the subject crypto asset uses, what the issuer operates and controls there (protocol, nodes and validators, stake and hash-power share, governance tokens, revenue, dependencies). Element names, datatypes and period types are unchanged from the BNP taxonomy filed with the FDIC, so facts compare across agencies. Offered under Rule 103(b)(9) (technology infrastructure, participants, and other parties and systems) and in answer to Request for Comment 28. The items reported for a period are in a table of their own, \"Rule 103(b)(9) — issuer blockchain network participation for the period\".",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": [
            "regca-complete:reference/2276",
            "regca-complete:reference/2277",
            "regca-complete:reference/2278",
            "regca-complete:reference/2279",
            "regca-complete:reference/2280",
            "regca-complete:reference/2281",
            "regca-complete:reference/2282",
            "regca-complete:reference/2283",
            "regca-complete:reference/2284"
          ],
          "mvf:hasMVFEntry": "regca-complete:mvf/entry/IssuerBlockchainNetworkParticipationAbstract"
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca:ThirdPartyServiceProviderByProviderTable",
          "rdfs:label": {
            "@value": "Third-party service provider by provider [table]",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "dct:source": [
            "regca-complete:reference/2324",
            "regca-complete:reference/2325",
            "regca-complete:reference/2326",
            "regca-complete:reference/2327",
